 NOISE MULTIPLICITY SENSITIVITY PROOF & INDEPENDENCE VERIFICATION
================================================================================
 Mathematical Formulation:
 For sample i, draw K independent noise tuples {(t_{i,k}, z_{0,i,k})}_{k=1}^K.
 Per-sample loss: L_i = (1/K) * sum_{k=1}^K ||v_theta(z_{t,i,k}, t_{i,k}) - u_{t,i,k}||^2
 Per-sample gradient: g_i = nabla_theta L_i.
 Clipped gradient: g_tilde_i = g_i / max(1, ||g_i||_2 / C).
 Global Sensitivity: Delta_2(sum_i g_tilde_i) <= C under add/remove adjacency.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
